&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;PNGTS accounts for leases in accordance with Docket No AI19-1-000 which permits the Company to record operating leases that may be capitalized under USGAAP in the FERC balance sheet accounts that have already been established for capital lease assets and liabilities. Docket No AI19-1000 did not impact any existing ratemaking treatment or practices and all other provisions of regulatory lease accounting are not affected. The amounts included in the balance sheet accounts that relate to operating leases at December 31, 2025 and 2024 are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;

