&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024 (Successor), PNGTS had an outstanding related party receivable of $7.3 million from related parties.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;"&gt;
	
		&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="vertical-align: top;"&gt;
			&lt;td style="width: 18pt;"&gt;
			&lt;p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td style="width: auto;"&gt;
			&lt;p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Distributions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
	
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;For the year ended, December 31, 2025, PNGTS declared and paid distributions to members of $107.2 million.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;During the Successor Period, from August 15, 2024 through December 31, 2024, PNGTS declared and paid distributions to members of $15.9 million.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;Prior to the Acquisition Transaction, at the direction of the Management Committee, PNGTS declared and paid quarterly distributions based on the most recently completed quarter end. During the Predecessor Period from January 1, 2024 through August 14, 2024, PNGTS paid distributions to its general partners of $76.5 million.&lt;/p&gt;

