&amp;#xa0;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;As of December 31, 2025, the Company does not expect non-vested equity performance-based awards to vest per the terms of the applicable award. As of December 31, 2025, the total future compensation cost related to non-vested equity time-awards was approximately $11.5 million to be recognized over the weighted-average period of 4 years.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;"&gt;
	
		&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="vertical-align: top;"&gt;
			&lt;td style="width: 18pt;"&gt;
			&lt;p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;13.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td style="width: auto;"&gt;
			&lt;p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
	
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 15pt;"&gt;On January 15, 2026, PNGTS paid a cash distribution in the amount of $28.9 million to the members.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 15pt;"&gt;On April 15, 2026, PNGTS paid a cash distribution in the amount of $30.6 million to the members.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 15pt;"&gt;Subsequent events have been assessed through June 22, 2026, which is the date the financial statements were issued, and management has concluded there were no events or transactions during this period that would require recognition or disclosure in the financial statements other than those already reflected here or in the preceding notes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;
</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
