	    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="ft-16383859514621_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Beehive Loop JV LLC ("Beehive Loop JV") owns, indirectly, 100% of each of Beehive Loop AcquisitionCo LLC and Beehive Loop StubCo LLC, which entities collectively own 100% of Respondent. North Haven Infrastructure Partners III (AIV-B) SCSp ("NHIP III") and BlackRock Global Infrastructure Fund IV, SCSp ("BGIF IV") each own an indirect 50% interest in Beehive Loop JV. As such, each of NHIP III and BGIF IV indirectly own 50% of Respondent. NHIP III is an affiliate of Morgan Stanley Infrastructure Partners, which is the infrastructure business of Morgan Stanley. BGIF IV is an affiliate of BlackRock, Inc.</link:footnote>
