		<link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="ft-16383859514637_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Rate schedule PAL is a balancing service; therefore, quantities are excluded as associated Dths used for balancing do not represent gas delivered.</link:footnote>
