		<link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#f-877" xlink:label="f-877_lbl" />
		<link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-877_lbl" xlink:to="ft-16383859514639_lbl" order="1" />
	
		<link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="ft-16383859514640_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">In FERC Docket No. CP18-539-000, Maritimes received authorization to abandon a portion of its ownership interest in the Westbrook Compressor Station by transfer to PNGTS upon completion of construction of the PNGTS expansion project proposed in that docket. PNGTS placed its expansion project into service on November 11, 2020. Pursuant to the Ownership Agreement between Maritimes and PNGTS, the expansion project, including PNGTS' acquisition of a portion of Maritimes' ownership interest in the Westbrook Compressor Station, required an update to the Ownership Interests for each of Maritimes and PNGTS, as set forth on Exhibit B to the Ownership Agreement. The Ownership Interests were updated pursuant to the terms of the Ownership Agreement.</link:footnote>
		<link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#f-948" xlink:label="f-948_lbl" />
