          <tr>
            <td colspan="18" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Pursuant to the Ownership Agreement between Maritimes and PNGTS, recent projects including the Portland XPress Project (&#8220;PXP&#8221;); (which includes but is not limited to PNGTS&#8217; acquisition of a portion of Maritimes&#8217; ownership interest in the Westbrook Compressor Station); necessitated updates to the Ownership Interests for each of Maritimes and PNGTS, as set forth on Exhibit B to the Ownership Agreement. PNGTS placed the last phase of PXP into service on November 11, 2020, pursuant to authorizations received in FERC Docket No. CP18-506-000. The Ownership Interest updates were finalized following completion of restoration activities and finalization of the costs of PXP. This finalization of the costs occurred during 2024 and the Ownership Interests were updated accordingly pursuant to the terms of the Ownership Agreement. Accordingly, the Ownership percentages reflected here represent the updated ownership interests.</span>
